<title>POLAND: Polish stocks close lower in continuous trade.</title>
<headline>Polish stocks close lower in continuous trade.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three stocks closed lower, one higher and four were flat in a 2.1-million-zloty turnover in Warsaw bourse continuous trade on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The remaining seven stocks did not trade.</p>
<p>NFI units rose in a 36.6-million-zloty turnover.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
